{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/ebb6ff0b20cf06af9f160df4fc565ac5.avif?t=1773071945\" width=800 height=94 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/37573bd86356f0b802913561415e82a1.poster.avif?t=1773071945\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/37573bd86356f0b802913561415e82a1.webm?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/37573bd86356f0b802913561415e82a1.mp4?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete global quests to expand your selection of playable characters, each featuring a distinct playstyle and a loyal pet companion.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf\u00a0<strong>Objective-Based Progress:</strong> Unlock new survivors and weapons by completing specific Quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e\u00a0<strong>Hero-Pet Synergy:</strong> Every character enters the arena with a unique pet that provides dedicated support and combat assistance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/50644d22c8ed4cf37627b277e83ae633.avif?t=1773071945\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/c64be2f40ec3f4ca3e85a8f4db32062c.poster.avif?t=1773071945\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/c64be2f40ec3f4ca3e85a8f4db32062c.webm?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/c64be2f40ec3f4ca3e85a8f4db32062c.mp4?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cycle through weapons, spells, passives, and gear \u2014 adapting to each wave\u2019s challenges.</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Area Weapons:</strong> Slam the ground to unleash shockwaves and <strong>obliterate groups of foes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff9 Projectile Weapons:</strong> <strong>Snipe enemies</strong> from afar or <strong>unleash deadly volleys</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Sword &amp; Shield:</strong> A perfect balance of <strong>offense</strong> and <strong>defense</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Utility Weapons:</strong> <strong>AoE damage</strong>, <strong>enemy control</strong>, and <strong>buffs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2e Summoning Staff or Spells:</strong> <strong>Call forth creatures</strong> to fight by your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2620\ufe0f Poison weapon or Spells:</strong> Inflicts <strong>poison (DoT)</strong> on enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a1 Projectile Spells:</strong> <strong>Direct</strong>, <strong>high-impact attacks</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 Area Spells:</strong> <strong>Devastating bursts</strong> or <strong>sustained damage</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Utility Spells:</strong> <strong>CC enemies</strong>, <strong>heal</strong>, or <strong>provide ressources</strong> on top of dealing damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcab Diverse passives and more!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/cd5f87ab7eafa37fc0b6bf8acf6aec1c.avif?t=1773071945\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/95fa8d230c50185a82dbcaf71bd712c9.poster.avif?t=1773071945\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/95fa8d230c50185a82dbcaf71bd712c9.webm?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/95fa8d230c50185a82dbcaf71bd712c9.mp4?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival requires active control. Use tactical movement and defensive abilities to navigate through relentless waves.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Sprint:</strong> Gain speed and pickup range, as well as health regeneration and damage reduction at the cost of disabling your weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca8\u00a0<strong>Dash:</strong> Use a quick dodge with invincibility frames to escape danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Defend:</strong> Use your shield to block incoming damage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/26e79f45f55e9710f28d55e79fec0294.avif?t=1773071945\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/1df19709a476474f74b86fbb45c47d69.poster.avif?t=1773071945\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/1df19709a476474f74b86fbb45c47d69.webm?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/1df19709a476474f74b86fbb45c47d69.mp4?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face dynamic objectives to maximize your hero's power throughout every run.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6\u00a0<strong>Wave Challenges:</strong> Complete specific mid-run challenges to earn powerful <strong>Legendary Passives</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8\u00a0<strong>Stat Evolution:</strong> Every level-up presents you with stat cards, allowing you to choose how your hero\u2019s attributes grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e\u00a0<strong>Volatile XP:</strong> Experience orbs turn hostile and fire projectiles at enemies if left uncollected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>The Pirate Slime:</strong> Hunt down the thief to reclaim stolen gold with interest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1\u00a0<strong>Dynamic Power-ups:</strong> Discover random drops from enemies or trigger unique passive abilities to shift the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/04a56bfdba3e7e17113a1c6598f7fd12.avif?t=1773071945\" width=800 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/2401f43771822dc105e5773256165cf2.poster.avif?t=1773071945\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/2401f43771822dc105e5773256165cf2.webm?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/2401f43771822dc105e5773256165cf2.mp4?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shop and gear systems focus on efficient progression without inventory clutter.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50\u00a0<strong>Star-Rank Progression:</strong> Power up your equipment by &quot;feeding&quot; duplicate items of any rarity directly into your equipped gear. Increase its Star-Rank without taking up extra inventory slots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9\u00a0<strong>Flexible Set System:</strong> Every set item provides a bonus starting at just one piece, with an upgraded bonus for equipping more (e.g., 3 pieces). This &quot;Mix and Match&quot; design removes the frustration of hunting for a single missing piece, allowing you to build your own custom synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78\u00a0<strong>Blood Money:</strong> Take a calculated risk at the shop by sacrificing your Health in exchange for Gold to fund critical upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2\u00a0<strong>Smart Shop Rotation:</strong> Gain more control over randomness. Items you reroll are less likely to reappear, making it easier to find the specific gear your build requires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728\u00a0<strong>Visual Customization:</strong> Your gear reflects on your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"GG EZ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428930/13484e545312feef3b6d8eeb7d005ba20e594da0.jpg"},{"name":"NANI?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428930/de30c4b3e54ae259d58b9111e12caf09dc83b49a.jpg"},{"name":"Professional Yapper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428930/bf5f26e670d6f4413eb78da6b87dd6bca37658fd.jpg"},{"name":"The Undaunted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428930/c7e847aaacfd354b8d29d81c4ad1ad69a8b2d757.jpg"},{"name":"The Noble Knight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428930/6bc15e55a7a2667ef385586f7c962ba053b3ede5.jpg"},{"name":"The Necromancer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428930/8c4fec3016dd4da1e37b9b29a3b7ef772f8293dc.jpg"},{"name":"The Oathkeeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428930/b03d4d3d207c246251af3b6dc8cd5afdcc17952c.jpg"},{"name":"The Jester","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428930/01e87f0738f303235951ef06e18546de5fefe114.jpg"},{"name":"The Arcbolt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428930/050431730b1994993b4a5863425bf233704a8a39.jpg"},{"name":"The Strategist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428930/7740aafec80568ba5a0124ef82db8894cd944675.jpg"}],"total":40},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3428930?t=1773071945","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/751db6fc1e68e29d32cbf905ee2a68ce63743090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773071945","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/a0632a09f3ba2bc4e4568dddb76d31aa60637f4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773071945","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/a0632a09f3ba2bc4e4568dddb76d31aa60637f4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773071945","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/ebb6ff0b20cf06af9f160df4fc565ac5.avif?t=1773071945\" width=800 height=94 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/37573bd86356f0b802913561415e82a1.poster.avif?t=1773071945\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/37573bd86356f0b802913561415e82a1.webm?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/37573bd86356f0b802913561415e82a1.mp4?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete global quests to expand your selection of playable characters, each featuring a distinct playstyle and a loyal pet companion.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf\u00a0<strong>Objective-Based Progress:</strong> Unlock new survivors and weapons by completing specific Quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e\u00a0<strong>Hero-Pet Synergy:</strong> Every character enters the arena with a unique pet that provides dedicated support and combat assistance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/50644d22c8ed4cf37627b277e83ae633.avif?t=1773071945\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/c64be2f40ec3f4ca3e85a8f4db32062c.poster.avif?t=1773071945\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/c64be2f40ec3f4ca3e85a8f4db32062c.webm?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/c64be2f40ec3f4ca3e85a8f4db32062c.mp4?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cycle through weapons, spells, passives, and gear \u2014 adapting to each wave\u2019s challenges.</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Area Weapons:</strong> Slam the ground to unleash shockwaves and <strong>obliterate groups of foes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff9 Projectile Weapons:</strong> <strong>Snipe enemies</strong> from afar or <strong>unleash deadly volleys</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Sword &amp; Shield:</strong> A perfect balance of <strong>offense</strong> and <strong>defense</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Utility Weapons:</strong> <strong>AoE damage</strong>, <strong>enemy control</strong>, and <strong>buffs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2e Summoning Staff or Spells:</strong> <strong>Call forth creatures</strong> to fight by your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2620\ufe0f Poison weapon or Spells:</strong> Inflicts <strong>poison (DoT)</strong> on enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a1 Projectile Spells:</strong> <strong>Direct</strong>, <strong>high-impact attacks</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 Area Spells:</strong> <strong>Devastating bursts</strong> or <strong>sustained damage</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Utility Spells:</strong> <strong>CC enemies</strong>, <strong>heal</strong>, or <strong>provide ressources</strong> on top of dealing damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcab Diverse passives and more!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/cd5f87ab7eafa37fc0b6bf8acf6aec1c.avif?t=1773071945\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/95fa8d230c50185a82dbcaf71bd712c9.poster.avif?t=1773071945\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/95fa8d230c50185a82dbcaf71bd712c9.webm?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/95fa8d230c50185a82dbcaf71bd712c9.mp4?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival requires active control. Use tactical movement and defensive abilities to navigate through relentless waves.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Sprint:</strong> Gain speed and pickup range, as well as health regeneration and damage reduction at the cost of disabling your weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca8\u00a0<strong>Dash:</strong> Use a quick dodge with invincibility frames to escape danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Defend:</strong> Use your shield to block incoming damage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/26e79f45f55e9710f28d55e79fec0294.avif?t=1773071945\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/1df19709a476474f74b86fbb45c47d69.poster.avif?t=1773071945\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/1df19709a476474f74b86fbb45c47d69.webm?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/1df19709a476474f74b86fbb45c47d69.mp4?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face dynamic objectives to maximize your hero's power throughout every run.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6\u00a0<strong>Wave Challenges:</strong> Complete specific mid-run challenges to earn powerful <strong>Legendary Passives</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8\u00a0<strong>Stat Evolution:</strong> Every level-up presents you with stat cards, allowing you to choose how your hero\u2019s attributes grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e\u00a0<strong>Volatile XP:</strong> Experience orbs turn hostile and fire projectiles at enemies if left uncollected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>The Pirate Slime:</strong> Hunt down the thief to reclaim stolen gold with interest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1\u00a0<strong>Dynamic Power-ups:</strong> Discover random drops from enemies or trigger unique passive abilities to shift the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/04a56bfdba3e7e17113a1c6598f7fd12.avif?t=1773071945\" width=800 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/2401f43771822dc105e5773256165cf2.poster.avif?t=1773071945\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/2401f43771822dc105e5773256165cf2.webm?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/2401f43771822dc105e5773256165cf2.mp4?t=1773071945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shop and gear systems focus on efficient progression without inventory clutter.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50\u00a0<strong>Star-Rank Progression:</strong> Power up your equipment by &quot;feeding&quot; duplicate items of any rarity directly into your equipped gear. Increase its Star-Rank without taking up extra inventory slots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9\u00a0<strong>Flexible Set System:</strong> Every set item provides a bonus starting at just one piece, with an upgraded bonus for equipping more (e.g., 3 pieces). This &quot;Mix and Match&quot; design removes the frustration of hunting for a single missing piece, allowing you to build your own custom synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78\u00a0<strong>Blood Money:</strong> Take a calculated risk at the shop by sacrificing your Health in exchange for Gold to fund critical upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2\u00a0<strong>Smart Shop Rotation:</strong> Gain more control over randomness. Items you reroll are less likely to reappear, making it easier to find the specific gear your build requires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728\u00a0<strong>Visual Customization:</strong> Your gear reflects on your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Doomasher Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/5fd5615631ac485d01de0f66fce9026f3bb28397/header.jpg?t=1773071945","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3428930/1943234942/c4742b4f9e5e8aa985110374d8339cdf1272ebe2/1770691784/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770696592","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3428930/1943234942/c4742b4f9e5e8aa985110374d8339cdf1272ebe2/1770691784/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770696592","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3428930/1943234942/c4742b4f9e5e8aa985110374d8339cdf1272ebe2/1770691784/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770696592","id":257283291,"name":"Slime Attack: Survivor - Official Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257283291/f2979c809b522ede13a3c9e2a4e192880b4df136/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770696592"}],"name":"Slime Attack: Survivor","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Slime Attack: Survivor - <span cla